BlockedLog=Αμετάβλητα αρχεία καταγραφής
BlockedLogDesc=This module tracks some events into an immutable log (that you can't modify once recorded) into a block chain, in real time. This module also provides features for compatibility with legal requirements of some countries (Spain, France - Loi Finance, ...).
Fingerprints=Αρχειοθετημένες ενέργειες και δακτυλικά αποτυπώματα
FingerprintsDesc=This is the tool to browse or extract the immutable logs. Immutable Logs are generated and store into a dedicated table of the systel, in real time when a business event appears.
ArchivesDesc=You can use this tool to export immutable logs into archive files. They are kept into the system but you should download and copy them into external supports.
ArchivesAuditorDesc=You can use this tool to load and control immutable logs from archive files.
ControlDesc=You can use this page to know if some backup restoration were done in the past (or if the last line of the immutable log was deleted) on a given instance
UnalterableLogTool1=Η νομοθεσία ορισμένων χωρών (όπως στη Γαλλία όταν κάνετε B2C), απαιτεί να το κάνετε σε τακτική βάση.
UnalterableLogTool1FR=Remind: In France, if you use the Point Of Sale feature, you MUST generate archives of the immutable logs, at least, once every year (Recommended once per month, via tab %s). Also, you MUST keep these archives for 7 years. According to the law, It is the user's responsibility to store their archives on media that guarantee their preservation, including in the event of hardware failure, so we recommand to store them on at least 2 different physical supports.
UnalterableLogTool2=The journal of Immutable Logs contains the history of data that need immutable recording.
UnalterableLogTool2MaxUsage=You have currently %s unalterable transactions. If you have a disk space of %s Gb, you can still record %s transactions (invoice/payment creation/modification) before you need to increase your disk size.
UnalterableLogTool2b=It is the responsibility of the user of the application to ensure backups in order to comply with legal obligations. When securing your immutable logs by exporting and storing archives files (from tab <b>%s</b>), it is recommended to store the exported archive files in at least 2 different places (Secured cloud, External USB drive, ...).
UnalterableLogTool3=Σημειώστε ότι δεν υπάρχει λειτουργία για την εκκαθάριση αυτού του αρχείου καταγραφής και κάθε αλλαγή που επιχειρείται να γίνει απευθείας σε αυτό το αρχείο καταγραφής (για παράδειγμα, από έναν χάκερ) θα αναφέρεται με ένα μη έγκυρο fingerprint.
UnalterableLogToolRegistrationFR=Before using a software compliant with VAT Anti-Fraud laws, you must register your contact information, in order to be informed of any issue or upgrade required by your installation. This may be a legal requirement of you country.
ApplicationUpdateResponsibilityFR=It is the user's responsibility to keep the application up to date and to ensure that updates are applied by their hosting provider.
ApplicationHasBeenRegistered=Your application has been registered.
InformationWillBePublishedTo=Συμπληρώστε και υποβάλετε αυτήν τη φόρμα.
InformationWillBePublishedTo2=All the following information will be pushed to the following organization: %s (See %s for the data privacy policy)
InformationWillBePublishedTo3=Also, each time you record a sensible data, a counter and footprint may be transferred to this organization too (to allow detection of data restauration or unallowed record deletion). If you don't agree with this, do not register and do not enable this module.
FingerprintsDesc2=Εάν οπωσδήποτε χρειάζεται να καθαρίσετε αυτόν τον πίνακα επειδή χρησιμοποιήσατε την εφαρμογή σας για σκοπούς επίδειξης/δοκιμής και θέλετε να καθαρίσετε τα δεδομένα σας για να ξεκινήσετε την παραγωγή σας, μπορείτε να ζητήσετε από τον μεταπωλητή ή τον πάροχο ολοκληρωμένων υπηρεσιών σας να επαναφέρει τη βάση δεδομένων σας (όλα τα δεδομένα σας θα καταργηθούν).
