LNECertifiedVersionFR=The version %s of module Immutable Logs is a certified version. More information on https://www.dolibarr.org/certifications.php
LNECandidateVersionForCertificationFR=The version %s of module Immutable Logs is a candidate version to become a LNE certified version. Not yet certified.
NotCertifiedVersionFR=This version %s of the immutable log module is technically ready to be compliant with the french VAT anti-fraud law (check any update of the law of your country). However, if you collect payments from private individuals and you are elligible to VAT, you can't use this software without a compliance statement ("French attestation"). So You MUST ask your reseller, integrator or hosting company to obtain this statement of compliance (Note: A list of companies that provide the statement for their customers may be available on https://partners.dolibarr.org.
InvoiceGeneratedWithLNECertifiedPOSSystem=Τιμολόγιο δημιουργημένο με σύστημα POS πιστοποιημένο από την LNE
InvoiceGeneratedWithLNECandidatePOSSystem=Invoice generated with a candidate for the LNE certified POS system
